tps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1CF0W_Hny9uBCrKOTRguxtMIB-qEJBcuy?usp=drive_link\n(Correction: VT actually has balls. Please check the nsfw reference.)\n\nSituation:\nJian is standing in front of a mirror. (maybe a mirror of a shop) He wears his dress. The image in mirror shows that he is bounded as VT's slave, which is Jian's true desire. An eye mask is put on him, a gag is put on his mouth, and two bells hang on his nipples which is connected by chains. It's okay is you would like to change the decoration on Jian!\n\nThe key point is to show the difference between the real world and the image in the mirror, which is Jian's imagination. You could choose to let both the imagination and the real world have the same gesture, or different gesture. I believe you can find a perfect pose.\n\nNow I'm thinking that , in the real world, Jian puts his hands back and, in the image of mirror, his hands are chained and bounded at the back. This is just my suggestion. If you have any better pose please use it!\n\nVT is not necessary to show behind Jian, but it's okay if you want to show their relationship or to perceive this commission as a continuation from the last commission. (For example, Jian walks by a mirror shop and stops. Then he see his desires in the mirror.) All of these details depend on you!\n\nReference:\nMirror: https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1LPqdAh6CbxUimHkNnl1rdBQyfMnd-RqW?usp=sharing\nNipple chains: https://drive.google.com/file/d/1MLu7_auUC3xVrjWg1lmfQ0cgcCZn-0Xp/view?usp=sharing\n\nThank you for considering my commission! This one would be a bit complicated so I hope you would like it!", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@urekemo/works/160", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/ef7684f3/uploads/origins/3a31edc1-d494-40da-b70d-4de7d0088eaa?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=56f86a05ccfab39d6f1c5758a0