ogle.com/file/d/16p7nDEN3cbGp_djcVOFLsJUwaO9ZiZ2y/view?usp=drive_link\nVT: https://drive.google.com/file/d/1cu7nn0O3CbR_HpITV84_Chgr5V2g_RBH/view?usp=drive_link\nPlease let them wear the same clothes as last time!\nPlease note that VT is a futa girl with a dick!\n\nI hope you can draw, Jian and VT having sex in a photo booth down the street. They make a pose for the camera so they can see Jian's strawberry pants. Jian makes a V sign again. Meanwhile, VT slips her hand into Jian's clothes and pinches his nipple so Jian submits to this sudden pleasure.\n\nYou can draw Jian smaller than VT in the body size if that helps you oeganize the drawing!\nYou can decide the format of commission to be a page of manga or an illustration!\n\nThen, thank you for considering my commission~\nHope you enjoy it~", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@urekemo/works/158", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/61938949/uploads/origins/cbea3682-db66-4f78-9f7e-fa3554d90ba4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=158b0b1a4db4f08074469841f8d0a673", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/61938949/uploads/origins/cbea3682-db66-4f78-9f7e-fa3554d90ba4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=158b0b1a4db4f08074469841f8d0a673, https://si.imgix.net/61938949/uploads/origins/cbea3682-db66-4f78-9f7e-fa3554d90ba4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=143e64560eb3e7c0a1cffffcd4527cb1 2x, https://si.imgix.net/61938949/uploads/origins/cbea3682-db66-4f78-9f7e-fa3554d90ba4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=51451232ba217b43ec740e904dc53799 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": true, "body": "いつもお世話になっております。\n兎神レイのイラストを依頼したいです。\n​───────​───────​────\n【シチュエーション】\n可愛いモコモコのパジャマ(女物)を着て、首輪と眼鏡を付けたレイさんが机に向かって何かを勉強している。左手にペンを持っていて、右手で首輪をいじっている。\nそれを横から見ている感じで、お願いします。可能であれば、左側に机、右側にレイさんがいるようにしてほしいです。\n\n【差分や枚数】\n健全絵と、この構図で可能であれば、えっち差分をお願いします。\n※無理そうなら健全絵1枚でお願いし